cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CIS2HDL: OrCAD Capture CIS to Cadence Design Entry HDL Schematic Converter"
abstract: >-
  CIS2HDL converts OrCAD Capture CIS schematics and libraries into Cadence
  Design Entry HDL (Concept HDL) project files. It parses binary DSN designs,
  EDIF netlists, PST side files and OLB libraries; resolves components against
  a target HDL symbol library with a two-stage matcher; lays out and wires the
  schematic; and emits a complete Design Entry HDL project tree together with a
  mapping table and diagnostics.
